{'symbol': 'FE', 'date': '2022-07-26 16:20:00', 'title': 'FIRSTENERGY ANNOUNCES SECOND QUARTER 2022 FINANCIAL RESULTS', 'text': 'REPORTS SECOND QUARTER 2022 GAAP EARNINGS OF $0.33 PER SHARE AND OPERATING (NON-GAAP) EARNINGS OF $0.53 PER SHARE, IN TOP END OF GUIDANCE RANGE CLOSED ON MINORITY SALE OF FET LLC, RAISING $2.4 BILLION AT HISTORIC PREMIUM VALUATION\xa0 SOLID EXECUTION TO IMPROVE THE BALANCE SHEET WITH OVER $2.5 BILLION OF DEBT RETIRED YEAR-TO-DATE ANTICIPATES ACHIEVING TARGETED FFO/DEBT OF ~13% IN 2023, AHEAD OF SCHEDULE UPDATES AND AFFIRMS FULL-YEAR GAAP AND OPERATING GUIDANCE AND PROVIDES OUTLOOK FOR THIRD QUARTER AKRON, OHIO , JULY 26, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- FIRSTENERGY CORP. (NYSE: FE) TODAY REPORTED SECOND QUARTER 2022 GAAP EARNINGS OF $187 MILLION, OR $0.33 PER BASIC AND DILUTED SHARE, ON REVENUE OF $2.8 BILLION. IN THE SECOND QUARTER OF 2021, THE COMPANY REPORTED GAAP EARNINGS OF $58 MILLION, OR $0.11 PER BASIC AND DILUTED SHARE, ON REVENUE OF $2.6 BILLION.'}